{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Devil's Terminal</i> is a Japanese Americana coming-of-age RPG about killing a demon at summer camp. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/86aadb74d7b9e4af2d65f97be83b4f68.poster.avif?t=1757678091\" width=614 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/86aadb74d7b9e4af2d65f97be83b4f68.webm?t=1757678091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/86aadb74d7b9e4af2d65f97be83b4f68.mp4?t=1757678091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DEMON</i></strong> <br>Being a teenager feels like being possessed. There\u2019s a demon that wants to keep you a loser. It wants you to suffer. It is the reason why teenagers write bad poetry. It is terrifying. Kill it, or die alone.\u00a0\u263a\ufe0e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>CLASSES</strong></i><br>Figure out who you want to be. By the end of this summer, you\u2019ll either become somebody, or stay a nobody. The demon will try to stop you from leveling up. The computer will help. Find the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>COOL KIDS</strong></i><br>You\u2019re surrounded by rebels. This is a camp for troubled children, but everyone\u2019s troubles are cooler than yours. Try to fit in with misfits. Try to go on a date with one. Try to make friends with another one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>ITEMS</strong></i><br>Games should have cool stuff. Like swords, or, sometimes, acorns. Stuff to use, collect, fight with, or solve puzzles with. In Devil\u2019s Terminal, most of those things were not designed to make sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/e72588e1496f5f41661cdd45f6ce3a52.poster.avif?t=1757678091\" width=800 height=1671 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/e72588e1496f5f41661cdd45f6ce3a52.webm?t=1757678091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3171510?t=1757678091","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3171510?t=1757678091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/445b7f2aec5be4e247d1916b37a51c7746fee26a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757678091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/445b7f2aec5be4e247d1916b37a51c7746fee26a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757678091","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3456750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Chat With The Team</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/1951c426ebf6e4ed3afa7c3c1124e065.avif?t=1757678091\" data-has-big width=800 height=184 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Devil's Terminal</i> is a Japanese Americana coming-of-age RPG about killing a demon at summer camp. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app